OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly fine but on the cloudy
OL,6,Fside at times. A few mainly light
OL,7,Fshowers are possible, with these more
OL,8,Flikely in the south and west, with the
OL,9,Feast brightest. Generally very warm
OL,10,Fand humid, but becoming breezier later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA fine evening leading into a
OL,13,Fvery mild night. Becoming cloudier
OL,14,Ffrom the west during the early hours,
OL,15,Fperhaps culminating in a little rain
OL,16,Fin the northwest by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
