OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FMild and humid to start, as a
OL,6,Fweakening band of rain moves
OL,7,Fsoutheast. Becoming drier, brighter
OL,8,Fand fresher later, with a breeze and
OL,9,Fsome warm sunny spells.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,12,Fchangeable period, with nearer-normal
OL,13,Ftemperatures than of late. Often fine
OL,14,Fbut breezy, with rain most likely on
OL,15,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
